(\(Tex. Spec. Ct. Rev. 2003\) \(“Article V, Sections 1-a\(8\) and 1-a\(9\) of the Texas) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.25 352.099 Tm
109 Tz
(Constitution refer to censure only within the context of formal proceedings, while) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.5 322.349 Tm
