1 0 0 1 72 232.6 Tm
(but did not discipline Judge Keller at its close. Instead, the Commission initiated formal) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 202.549 Tm
100 Tz
(proceedings. A four-day trial was held before Judge Berchelmann, who concluded, based) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.25 172.799 Tm
101 Tz
(on his Findings of Fact, that Judge Keller should not be disciplined. Then the SCJC held) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.5 142.799 Tm
100 Tz
(a hearing, and was unable to garner the constitutionally required seven votes required for) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.5 113.049 Tm
