102 Tz
/OPBaseFont0 13 Tf
(125 S.W.2d 272, 274 \(Tex. 1939\). “A judgment) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.25 474.699 Tm
105 Tz
(which discloses its invalidity on its face anywhere at any time is a nullity and may be) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.25 444.75 Tm
101 Tz
(disregarded anywhere at any time.” ) Tj
1 0 0 1 263.05 444.699 Tm
