99 Tz
(Court may vacate the Order and declare it void. As the Texas Supreme Court stated:) Tj
1 0 0 1 108 298.299 Tm
111 Tz
(While it is wholly unnecessary to appeal from a void judgment, it is) Tj
1 0 0 1 108 283.199 Tm
102 Tz
(nevertheless settled that an appeal may be taken and the appellate court in) Tj
1 0 0 1 108.5 268.299 Tm
99 Tz
(such proceeding may declare the judgment void.) Tj
