(Here, Judge Keller received no notice that the Commission would consider a public) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.25 558.45 Tm
101 Tz
(warning as possible punishment, and therefore was not able to address the constitutional) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 528.5 Tm
108 Tz
(infirmity of such a punishment at the June 2010 hearing. Furthermore, if the Court) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 498.75 Tm
103 Tz
(rewards the Commission with a new trial, Judge Keller will be forced to try a different) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.25 468.699 Tm
(case than was tried before Judge Berchelmann, because the Examiner has changed her) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 439 Tm
99 Tz
(theory of the case \(for the second time\) and brought different charges against her, thereby) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 409 Tm
102 Tz
(penalizing Judge Keller for appealing to this Special Court of Review. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 450.7 408.949 Tm
