(417 U.S. 21, 30-31, 94 S.Ct. 2098 \(1974\) \(holding that the potential for) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 349.199 Tm
99 Tz
(prosecutorial vindictiveness against those who seek to exercise their right to appeal raised) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.5 319.199 Tm
103 Tz
(sufficiently serious due process concerns to require a rule forbidding the State to bring) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 289.449 Tm
