(presented at its hearing. At that point, the Texas Constitution gave the SCJC three) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.25 618.25 Tm
105 Tz
(options: dismiss the charges, as recommended by Judge Berchelmann; censure Judge) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.25 588.45 Tm
