1 0 0 1 72.25 558.45 Tm
98 Tz
(Constitution states as follows:) Tj
1 0 0 1 108 528.5 Tm
102 Tz
(After such investigation as it deems necessary, the Commission may in its) Tj
1 0 0 1 108.25 513.599 Tm
