(available to the SCJC. The SCJC’s illegal conduct in issuing a public warning, rather) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 678 Tm
101 Tz
(than dismissing all charges, should not be rewarded with a new trial – particularly a new) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 648.25 Tm
100 Tz
(trial based on false charges. The Constitution should be enforced, and all charges against) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 618.25 Tm
99 Tz
