3 Tr
/OPBaseFont0 13 Tf
(voted for the public warning is the SCJC’s doing; it decided to deliberate secretly and to) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 678 Tm
98 Tz
(keep secret its members’ votes.) Tj
1 0 0 1 235.45 684.25 Tm
99 Tz
/OPBaseFont0 7 Tf
(11) Tj
1 0 0 1 108 648.25 Tm
117 Tz
/OPBaseFont0 13 Tf
(The SCJC denied Judge Keller her right to be judged only by qualified) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.25 618.25 Tm
122 Tz
(Commissioners. This Court cannot divine what influence the disqualified) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.25 588.25 Tm
101 Tz
(Commissioners had on their colleagues. In light of the illegality of the Order, there is no) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 558.5 Tm
105 Tz
(basis for this Court to presume that the participation of three disqualified members in) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 528.5 Tm
99 Tz
(issuing the Order resulted in anything other than a void Order.) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.25 498.25 Tm
123 Tz
/OPBaseFont2 12 Tf
(IV. CONCLUSION) Tj
1 0 0 1 108 471.599 Tm
107 Tz
/OPBaseFont0 13 Tf
(The Order violates the Constitution and is void. The Order was entered by an) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 441.849 Tm
106 Tz
(illegally constituted Commission which issued a public warning it was barred by the) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.25 412.049 Tm
100 Tz
(Constitution from entering. Because the Commission’s only constitutional option, absent) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.5 382.099 Tm
102 Tz
(a finding of good cause for disciplining Judge Keller, was to dismiss all charges against) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 352.099 Tm
99 Tz
(her, this Court should do the Commission’s constitutional duty, as it has proved incapable) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.25 322.299 Tm
105 Tz
(of complying with the law. To allow these proceedings to continue would reward the) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.25 292.349 Tm
116 Tz
(Commission for violating the Constitution and abusing Judge Keller’s rights.) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 262.549 Tm
101 Tz
(Furthermore, the Commission’s Charging Document shows on its face that no discipline) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.5 232.549 Tm
107 Tz
(against Judge Keller is appropriate: she is not accused of violating any law, rule, or) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.7 176.399 Tm
140 Tz
/OPBaseFont0 7 Tf
(11 ) Tj
1 0 0 1 84.95 170.199 Tm
101 Tz
/OPBaseFont0 13 Tf
(Given the secrecy of the SCJC’s deliberations and its refusal to disclose the identities) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.25 155.299 Tm
100 Tz
(of the Commissioners voting for the Order, the SCJC’s deliberations and Order are more) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.5 140.199 Tm
105 Tz
(analogous to a jury deliberation and verdict than to a court ruling. It is presumptively) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 125.299 Tm
100 Tz
(harmful when objectionable jurors are improperly allowed to participate in the rendering) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.25 110.399 Tm
102 Tz
(of a verdict: the harm is caused not by the verdict, but by the corruption of the process.) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 95.299 Tm
116 Tz
/OPBaseFont3 11 Tf
(See Cortez v. HCCI-San Antonio, Inc., ) Tj
1 0 0 1 276.949 95.299 Tm
98 Tz
/OPBaseFont0 13 Tf
